SetNewLockerFactoryIntegrationConcreteTest
├── When caller is not owner
│   └── It should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount}
└── When caller is owner
    ├── When the new locker factory is the zero address
    │   └── It should revert with {ZeroAddress}
    └── When the new locker factory is not the zero address
        ├── It should set the new locker factory
        └── It should emit a {NewLockerFactorySet} event
